D30: complete 1,680-cell 4th-down grid (incl. OT), one shared key function for builder and
engine, Dirichlet shrinkage with k by method of moments per level; hand defaults removed.
D32: alive was reset to ~game_over before the scrimmage block, so every kneel was followed by
a snap in the same iteration (leaders ended 15% of late drives on downs; real 2%).
D33: FG-setup state cells — kneel, play call, in-state rush yardage, next-snap-time runoff.
D34: spikes in the end-of-half FG setup.
K1 (1,087 x 500): late-drive mix now matches at the drive level; tied at 2:00 -> |final|=3
54% (real 80%, was 34%); headline P(|final|=3) 8.1% (14.5%, was 7.7%) — the margin histogram
is smoothed vs reality already at 5:00; scoring-event composition is the next diagnostic.
Tests: 86 pass / 3 red (5A-3 go rate, 5A-4 penalties, 5A-9 tied-drive expiry); three tests
updated for changed premises (D27 z10, D33, D32).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QMk9gfHmH2aTN5pwMcY52R
